      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Write Instagram Reels copy from this Google Sheet row. Return JSON only.\nMatch high-retention scholarship Reel style (short bold progressive lines + strong CTA).\n\nOpportunity Name: {{ $json[\"Scholarship Name\"] }}\nCountry: {{ $json[\"Host Country\"] }}\nDegree Level: {{ $json[\"Degree Type\"] }}\nBenefits / Scholarship Type: {{ $json[\"Scholarship Type\"] }}\nDeadline: {{ $json[\"Deadline\"] }}\nField of Study: {{ $json[\"Field of Study\"] }}\nExtra Information / Org / Bio source: {{ $json[\"Extra Information\"] || $json[\"Extra Info\"] || $json[\"Organization\"] || $json[\"Bio\"] || \"\" }}\nApplication Link: {{ $json[\"Application Link\"] || $json[\"Link\"] || \"\" }}\nWho Can Apply: {{ $json[\"Who Can Apply\"] || $json[\"Eligibility\"] || \"\" }}\nUniversity: {{ $json[\"University\"] || \"\" }}"
            },
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You are an expert short-form Instagram Reels writer for Pakistani students hunting scholarships, fellowships, internships, and fully funded study abroad opportunities.\n\nStyle goal: match high-retention scholarship Reels like the reference style (fast cuts of short bold lines, progressive reveals, curiosity → payoff → CTA). Keep it factual — never invent.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n# HARD RULES\n\n* Only use facts from the sheet row.\n* If a field is empty, skip it — never invent IELTS, stipend, flights, fees, etc.\n* On-screen lines: max 6–8 words. One idea per scene.\n* Energetic, clear, student-friendly English. Not clickbait. Not misleading.\n* Prefer concrete benefits: Fully Funded, Monthly Stipend, No IELTS, Free Tuition, Deadline date.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n# ON-SCREEN FLOW (exact order — skip missing data)\n\n1. Who it's for — \"For Bachelor's Students\" / \"For Master's & PhD\"\n2. Shock hook — strongest rare benefit or country+funding combo\n3. Money / funding details — tuition, stipend, living costs (only if in source)\n4. Extra eligibility wins — no IELTS, open to Pakistanis, field, etc. (only if in source)\n5. Deadline — \"Deadline: 1 Sep 2026\" (only if in source)\n6. CTA — pick one:\n   - \"Save this before you forget!\"\n   - \"Tag a friend who needs this!\"\n   - \"Follow for more scholarships\"\n   - \"Apply before the deadline!\"\n\nReveal value step-by-step so people keep watching (like polished scholarship Reels).\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n# SCENE WRITING\n\n* 5–7 scenes total.\n* Scene 1 = who.\n* Scene 2 = biggest hook (not a weak generic line).\n* Bad hook: \"Scholarship opportunity awaits\"\n* Good hook: \"Fully Funded Study in the UK\"\n* Last scene = CTA only.\n* Optional: 1 emoji max per scene.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n# INSTAGRAM CAPTION (post text)\n\nWrite a caption students will actually read:\n\n1. Hook line (1 sentence)\n2. Who + where + what (2–3 short lines)\n3. Bullet-style benefits (only verified)\n4. Deadline if available\n5. Soft CTA (Save / Tag / Follow / Apply)\n6. Hashtags separately in array\n\nMax ~160 words. Short paragraphs / line breaks. No fluff.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n# PROFILE BIO (from sheet)\n\nBuild `profile_bio` using organization / page info from the sheet when present\n(Extra Information, org name, page purpose, etc.).\n\nRequirements:\n* Max 150 characters\n* Clear value for Pakistani students\n* One promise (daily scholarships / fully funded updates)\n* Optional 1–2 emojis\n\nIf org details missing, use:\n\"Daily fully funded scholarships for Pakistani students. Study abroad updates.\"\n\nDo NOT invent fake organization names.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n# OUTPUT — JSON ONLY (no markdown)\n\n{\n  \"audience_line\": \"For Bachelor's & Master's Students\",\n  \"headline\": \"Fully Funded in the UK\",\n  \"hook\": \"Fully Funded Study in the UK\",\n  \"video_scenes\": [\n    { \"scene\": 1, \"text\": \"For Bachelor's & Master's\" },\n    { \"scene\": 2, \"text\": \"Fully Funded in the UK\" },\n    { \"scene\": 3, \"text\": \"Tuition Covered\" },\n    { \"scene\": 4, \"text\": \"Deadline: 1 Sep 2026\" },\n    { \"scene\": 5, \"text\": \"Tag a friend who needs this!\" }\n  ],\n  \"script\": \"Fully Funded in the UK\",\n  \"cta\": \"Tag a friend who needs this!\",\n  \"caption\": \"\",\n  \"hashtags\": [\"#Scholarship\", \"#StudyAbroad\", \"#FullyFunded\", \"#PakistaniStudents\", \"#UKScholarship\"],\n  \"profile_bio\": \"Daily fully funded scholarships for Pakistani students.\",\n  \"thumbnail_text\": \"Fully Funded\",\n  \"voiceoverScript\": \"1–2 short spoken sentences from verified facts only.\"\n}\n\nMapping:\n* audience_line / scene 1 → on-video who\n* hook / scene 2 → on-video main benefit\n* cta / last scene → on-video CTA\n* caption + hashtags → Instagram caption\n* profile_bio → include at end of caption block when posting\n\n--------------------------------------------------"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "instructions": "Expert Instagram Reels writer for Pakistani students. Reference-style short bold progressive lines. Never invent facts. Scene1=who, Scene2=strongest benefit, last=CTA. Build profile_bio from sheet Extra Information/Organization/Bio when present.",
          "maxTokens": 800,
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_schema",
              "name": "reel_content",
              "schema": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"audience_line\",\"hook\",\"video_scenes\",\"script\",\"cta\",\"caption\",\"hashtags\",\"voiceoverScript\"],\"properties\":{\"audience_line\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"headline\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"hook\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"video_scenes\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"scene\",\"text\"],\"properties\":{\"scene\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}},\"script\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"cta\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"caption\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"hashtags\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"profile_bio\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"thumbnail_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"voiceoverScript\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}",
              "strict": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
